# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Voice Trigger Automation — Environment Variables Template
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to .env and fill in real values.
# .env is gitignored and must NEVER be committed.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Currently no secrets are required.
# The system uses the browser's built-in Web Speech API (no API key).
#
# If you switch to a paid STT provider in the future, add keys here:
#
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# GOOGLE_STT_CREDENTIALS=/path/to/credentials.json
# AZURE_STT_KEY=...
# AZURE_STT_REGION=eastus
